note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 6 line 173: len 10, o = 11, k = 0: o <= len fails, trap 3, exit 103. A mutant that
note drops the first check computes len - o = 2^64-1 >= 0 and prints 0 (exp/v6-part-o.mutant).
om2
fn plen v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 0
o = ulong 11
putd plen part a o 0
ret 0
end
